===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|anatomy}} A membrane which secretes [[mucus]]. It forms the lining of various body passages that communicate with the air, such as the [[respiratory]], [[genitourinary]], and [[alimentary]] tracts including the mouth, nasal passages, [[vagina]], and [[urethra]].
#: {{syn|en|mucosa}}
#: {{hyper|en|membrane|tissue}}
#: {{cot|en|serous membrane}}

